  <h2>What stayed with me</h2>
  <blockquote>The best feature was a phone number. People trust a human before they trust a platform.</blockquote>
  <p>Shipping the whole stack alone taught me where polish matters and where speed matters more. Numbers, screenshots and a proper retrospective will replace this placeholder soon.</p>

  <aside class="callout wobbly wobbly--2" aria-label="Note">
    <Icon name="lightbulb" />
    <p>This page is a living write-up with placeholder copy. The real story, with screenshots and numbers, lands here soon.</p>
  </aside>
</WorkLayout>
